Queens iconography  but updated it giving Margot Robbie a  playful but deviant look and what would  Harley Quinn be without  the Joker Ayers Joker played by Jared  Leto is tatted out and styled after drug  lords the a or saw on Instagram  controversial maybe but apparently the  tattoos tell part of Joker's backstory I  can't wait to show you my toys  indeed Suicide Squad might be our first  chance to really explore some of our  favorite characters stories the time has  come for the bad guys to shine
 

